{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_banner01.png?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caput Mortum is a short first-person horror experience inspired by retro 3D dungeon crawlers and survival horror games. It focuses on exploration and atmosphere while providing puzzles, simple combat, and light resource management.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif01.gif?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a control scheme reminiscent of old-school dungeon crawlers that makes you feel more vulnerable. Control your right hand with the right thumbstick to interact with objects and attack creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Caput Mortum</i> is meant to be played with a <strong>controller</strong>, but a more <strong>standard keyboard and mouse</strong> control scheme is also available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slow Burn Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif02.gif?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close the lights, put on headphones, and immerse yourself in the game's macabre world. You'll need to pay attention to the environment to <strong>solve puzzles</strong> and piece together the events that took place within the tower. How deep are you willing to go, and what terrible truths will you uncover?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nightmarish Beings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif03.gif?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must stay vigilant, as <strong>varied monsters</strong> roam the abandoned halls of the tower and won't hesitate to attack. Stealth past them or fight back, but be mindful of your health: There is a limited quantity of healing herbs you'll be able to scavenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/WildArts_Logo_MadeByHumans_banner.png?t=1745520979\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555980?t=1745520979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/78972b7e106d883a29e78bce31dd93231850e861/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745520979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/c6bb33c5bbd8973f9fde3994219f2b02d76f6892/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745520979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/c6bb33c5bbd8973f9fde3994219f2b02d76f6892/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745520979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of death; monstrous creatures; experiments on humans; and horror themes."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3651330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_banner01.png?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caput Mortum is a short first-person horror experience inspired by retro 3D dungeon crawlers and survival horror games. It focuses on exploration and atmosphere while providing puzzles, simple combat, and light resource management.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif01.gif?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a control scheme reminiscent of old-school dungeon crawlers that makes you feel more vulnerable. Control your right hand with the right thumbstick to interact with objects and attack creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Caput Mortum</i> is meant to be played with a <strong>controller</strong>, but a more <strong>standard keyboard and mouse</strong> control scheme is also available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slow Burn Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif02.gif?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close the lights, put on headphones, and immerse yourself in the game's macabre world. You'll need to pay attention to the environment to <strong>solve puzzles</strong> and piece together the events that took place within the tower. How deep are you willing to go, and what terrible truths will you uncover?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nightmarish Beings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif03.gif?t=1745520979\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must stay vigilant, as <strong>varied monsters</strong> roam the abandoned halls of the tower and won't hesitate to attack. Stealth past them or fight back, but be mindful of your health: There is a limited quantity of healing herbs you'll be able to scavenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/WildArts_Logo_MadeByHumans_banner.png?t=1745520979\" /></p>","developers":["WildArts Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/hea